    <releases>
      <release timestamp="1793750400" type="stable" version="67.6">
        <description>
          <ul>
            <li>Added bottle moves between directories and a destination picker when duplicating bottles</li>
            <li>Added per-bottle notes and library sorting by bottle name</li>
            <li>Added Default, Application and System DPI scaling modes in Advanced Display Settings</li>
            <li>Added optional UMU controls, support for launch wrappers and download status in the library</li>
            <li>Added a playtime reset button and warnings for missing program files without removing
            shortcuts</li>
            <li>Fixed interrupted downloads on slow connections with a longer read timeout and bounded
            retries</li>
            <li>Fixed startup delays, repeated Battle.net launches and saving imported bottles on external
            drives</li>
            <li>Fixed Windows XP selection on 64-bit bottles and switching between Fsync and NTSync</li>
            <li>Fixed restoring the Windows version after dependency installation, dependency progress
            and multiple uninstallers</li>
            <li>Fixed Wine server shutdown and added an installer option to stop completed sessions</li>
            <li>Fixed GL32 debug symbol mounts and exposed the selected Wine executable to launch scripts</li>
            <li>Updated the experimental Soda catalogs and installer progress logs</li>
          </ul>
        </description>
      </release>
      <release timestamp="1793059200" type="stable" version="67.5">
        <description>
          <ul>
            <li>Fixed template downloads, offline component selection and component updates</li>
            <li>Fixed dependency installation with the Z: drive disabled and reporting installer failures</li>
            <li>Preserved prefix architecture and user files when importing or restoring bottles</li>
            <li>Fixed desktop shortcuts, executable drag and drop, and bottle ordering</li>
            <li>Fixed UMU controller access and retrying failed game searches</li>
            <li>Applied the Wayland setting when launching Proton</li>
            <li>Added optional Eagle tracing and native analysis with compatible Soda runners</li>
            <li>Added the identity bridge for compatible Soda runners</li>
            <li>Displayed total playtime in hours</li>
          </ul>
        </description>
      </release>
      <release timestamp="1788739200" type="stable" version="67.4">
        <description>
          <ul>
            <li>Fixed Battle.net crashes with Soda</li>
            <li>Fixed first-run videos freezing in KiriKiri games</li>
          </ul>
        </description>
      </release>
      <release timestamp="1788739200" type="stable" version="67.3">
        <description>
          <ul>
            <li>Restored Flatpak compatibility for 32-bit runners and media codecs</li>
            <li>Fixed Steam runtime launches when the runtime path uses a symbolic link</li>
            <li>Fixed opening selected directories from the Flatpak package</li>
            <li>Added the ARM64 Cpak package with Soda runner support</li>
            <li>Hidden the component update section when no updates are available</li>
          </ul>
        </description>
      </release>
    </releases>
